+  --require-fcd \
+  --output-dir outputs/attributed_generation/qm9_spectral_cycle_graphlet_v2_reuse/seed_42/evaluation
+```
+
+### Full v2 training
+
+The typed-degree prior can be reused when this checkpoint already exists:
+
+```text
